  "definition": "DBS Analysis",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-01-25",
  "historyNote": "#8529, eff 12-23-05; ss by #8875, eff 4-25-07; ss by #9725, eff 7-1-10; ss by #12632, eff 9-28-18; ss by #13530, eff 1-25-23",
